WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Step 1: Check people, times, positions, breaks and the selected week.

2
00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:20.625
Step 2: Resolve invalid or overlapping shifts and review availability, leave and cost warnings. Red card borders take priority even on a previously published shift. Hover over the card’s top, focus the card, or click its red error icon to read the relevant issues.

3
00:00:20.625 --> 00:00:31.500
Step 3: Wait for draft saves to finish, then choose Publish roster. Green borders mark unchanged published shifts when they have no current issues. A green border indicates publication, not legal compliance.

4
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:38.625
Step 4: When award checks require a review note, review the warning and enter the required note before completing publication.
